# `space.active`

The active space, if one has been activated.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.space.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`ActiveSpace` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `active` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call space.active --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "active": {
    "id": "harbor",
    "path": "/home/dev/harbor",
    "name": "Harbor",
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "last_seen_at": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z"
  }
}
```
